    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Embark on an enchanting journey through the vibrant, mystical world of Zulu legend in Tower of Wishes: Shaka</i></strong>, a captivating match-3 adventure that blends rich storytelling with engaging puzzle gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Ilanga faces its darkest hour. Invaders with fire-breathing weapons threaten your borders, an unnatural drought withers your crops, and the amadlozi keep demanding ever increasing sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The situation is grim and there is but one hope: <strong><i>The Tower of Wishes, an ancient monument that appears only when the moon swallows the sun.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the noble king Vusumuzi, ascend the tower, solving puzzles, matching beads and overcoming challenges to save your people from famine, invaders, and the wrath of the ancestral spirits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun match-3 puzzles that test your wit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games Galore: Play mini-games that offer different challenges, from hidden objects to jigsaw puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the Tower as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >African themed art that brings the Tower of Wishes to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a wish that will shape the future of your kingdom and its people.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Embark on an enchanting journey through the vibrant, mystical world of Zulu legend in Tower of Wishes: Shaka</i></strong>, a captivating match-3 adventure that blends rich storytelling with engaging puzzle gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Ilanga faces its darkest hour. Invaders with fire-breathing weapons threaten your borders, an unnatural drought withers your crops, and the amadlozi keep demanding ever increasing sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The situation is grim and there is but one hope: <strong><i>The Tower of Wishes, an ancient monument that appears only when the moon swallows the sun.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the noble king Vusumuzi, ascend the tower, solving puzzles, matching beads and overcoming challenges to save your people from famine, invaders, and the wrath of the ancestral spirits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun match-3 puzzles that test your wit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games Galore: Play mini-games that offer different challenges, from hidden objects to jigsaw puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the Tower as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >African themed art that brings the Tower of Wishes to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a wish that will shape the future of your kingdom and its people.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a match-3 journey through the mystical Zulu world in Tower of Wishes: Shaka.Threatened by invaders and an unnatural drought, the kingdom of Ilanga faces its darkest hour. Ascend the legendary Tower of Wishes, solve match-3 puzzles, overcome challenges and shape the future of your kingdom.",
